Rāma sees dread omens and warns Lakṣmaṇa --- Rāma leads monkey host to Laṅkā --- Rāma blockades four gates with captains --- Monkeys roar and shake walled Laṅkā --- Rāma sends Aṅgada with surrender message --- Aṅgada delivers ultimatum before Rāvaṇa --- Aṅgada hurls guards and shatters palace tower --- Vānaras tighten siege while rākṣasas arm